window.products.push({"id":764067,"name":"CAST IRON Antique Style CLOAK ROOM PLAQUE | toilet | loo | hotel |Guest House | Restaurant | Pub | Inn | Bed and Breakfast | Cloakroom| supplied with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617JLvHwMYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This CAST-IRON CLOAK ROOM PLAQUE has a natural authentic finish that will naturally age over time. The perfect addition to any home, adds the perfect finishing touch to any cloakroom, bathroom, or loo Carefully hand crafted and submitted to a five-stage finishing process, they are waxed using a maintenance wax which serves as a basic protection to moisture. CAST in SOLID CAST IRON to last a lifetime using the finest high-quality materials, cast Iron items will age naturally and develop their own patina over time. Approx. size 15cm (w) x 5m (h) with a thickness of 1cm | 6 inches (L) x 2 Inches with a thickness of 0.25 inches, supplied with 2 matching slotted head screws for easy fixing The name cloakroom harks back to a time when the wearing of an over cloak was common. A cloak room was therefore designed near the main entrance of the home and public buildings. This is where these outer garments were left as you entered the property. Over time and after the demise of the cloak, the cloak room in an Edwardian or Victorian house has been adapted. They have been turned into a small toilet and hand basin room with the term cloakroom still being used even in new builds. The concept of a cloakroom still exists in large hotels, venues, and conference centres. These still have cloakrooms for guests to leave coats, bags and anything they do not want to take into the main building. Cast iron is made from pig iron, which is the product of melting iron ore in a blast furnace. Cast iron can be made directly from the molten pig iron or by re-melting pig iron, often along with substantial quantities of iron, steel, limestone, carbon (coke) and taking various steps to remove undesirable contaminants","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617JLvHwMYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thorness","source_asin":"B07QC2ZXP4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QC2ZXP4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QC2ZXP4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
