window.products.push({"id":764109,"name":"Ice Cube Trays with Lids, 3 Pack 108 Ice Cubes Silicone Ice Cube Trays Flexible 36 Ice Trays for Freezer Whiskey Cocktail Stackable Ice Cube Molds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kw2Xm-KHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Why chose silicone ice cube trays ? Safe! Silicone doesn't contain any BPA, so you're good on that front if you choose silicone ice trays as an alternative to plastic. ... Silicone ice cube trays are soft and pliable, and they don't appear to leach any unsafe thing into food or water at cold temperatures. Must Have In Such a Hot Summer 36 Cube Silicone Ice Cube Tray is a must-have for anyone who values an ice cold beverage. This durable silicone tray freezes 36 ice cubes that melt slower and chill your drink longer. Less exposed surface area equals slower cube melting. Understanding this scientific fact is crucial during hot summer days, when enjoying an expensive bottle of spirits and in the midst of a cocktail party where chatting is preferred to guzzling a watery drink. Multiple Creative Uses Cocktail lovers can use the cubes to make Juleps, Mojitos, swizzles, and more, but outside of boozy drinks, the cubes are small enough to fit in water bottles, iced coffees,smoothies, and baby bottles. ice cube tray are ideal tool for making miniature desserts, popsicles, puddings, fruit jellies, chocolates, cake, or storing things like herbs or stock How To Get Ice Out Easily 1. Please don't rush to twist the tray to prevent from cracking after taking it out from fridge, drench the tray with water first, or rest it for 3 minutes to let ice melt a little.2.then remove the lid, and press the silicone bottom to release the cubes. It will be very easy! Note: 1. Do not use metal brush to clean these ice cube trays.2. Do not clean the trays with strong detergent in case they get corroded.3. Wash the trays with soap and hot water before first use.4.You'd better fill ice cubes to a max of 3/4th full. Specifications Dimensions: 7.9\"x 3.5\" x 1\"Cube size: 1\" x 1\"Temperature: -40℉~356℉ Package Included 3 Pack Ice cube trays with lids","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kw2Xm-KHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Timtop","source_asin":"B089DKHTR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089DKHTR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089DKHTR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
