window.products.push({"id":764217,"name":"Artisanal Hand Painted Glassware Gift for Mom, Wife, Friend - Artisanal Barcelona Hand Painted Whiskey & Wine Decanter Set, Rennesance Romantic Stain-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+OCK08TFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COLOR MAY VARY AS THESE ARE HAND PAINTED - BEAUTIFUL MASTERPIECE: Rennesance Romantic Stain-glassed Windows Whiskey & Wine Decanter and Glasses - These hand painted glasses were individually made by artisan glassblowers and uniquely crafted. Each individual set comes with A decanter wood base holder and 4 hand-painted glasses designed for you or a loved one. HAND-MADE: Each glass was handmade to perfection, support hard working masters which blow each individual glass, it is then passed along checked for safety and hand painted with a glowing paint, made to sparkle and shine any elegant table, gathering , or occasion PERFECT GIFT: This Hand painted wine and whiskey decanter/glasses are an absolute must for a gift, made for all occasions, and more gorgeous in person than can be viewed online. You will be happy you gave these wine glasses as a gift. These would make a remarkable gift for a wedding present gift, housewarming gift, engagement gift, Valentine gift, anniversary gift, mothers day gift, or an any day occasion to celebrate with a loved one MADE FOR WINE, SPIRITS AND WHISKEY : Made to go with any wine white or red, liquor, burbon, water or juice, or your favorite soft drink. Makes an awesome picnic outing stylish with flare. 16 Ounce glasses, 750ml Decanter Handle with care, these hand-painted wine glasses should be hand washed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+OCK08TFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Wine Savant","source_asin":"B0C2SLV82Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2SLV82Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2SLV82Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":764218,"name":"Q: Vinyl Accessories Record Wall Mounts, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bRzI5h-XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Q is a modular, damage-free mounting solution for vinyl records. As a record collector, you already own your favorite artwork. Using our innovative installation process, our wall mounts eliminate nearly 95% of the material used in traditional frames. Don't settle for cheap posters or expensive frames to showcase your music. Use our record mounts to create wall art that brings your space to life and allows you to easily adjust, change, and play the records you want keep on display. From the Manufacturer Dis(play) your vinyl We understand that the most important part of vinyl records is playing them. Traditional record frames make it hard to play records on display and often require complete dismantling to get to an album. We designed our mounts without any moving pieces or covers to make it easy to place, remove and and play albums that are on display. Your music, your walls With it’s modular design, a single mount can be responsible for holding 1-4 records in place. By doing so, larger displays become exponentially more cost effective as fewer mounts are needed to create a display. From a single row of records to a full wall, the possibilities are endless and we give you the freedom to create a display that fits your style and brings your space to life. Simple Installation The included Q Guide eliminates the need for measurements or tools and ensures accurate wall placement every time. Simply align the guide on the wall and place mounts in each corner of the guide. Continue to use the guide to expand the display in any direction. Damage-Free Installation The removable adhesives are perfect for dorms or apartments and remove cleanly without causing any damage. When properly installed, the adhesive discs have a strong bond to any smooth surface and will easily hold the weight of any single record. *Adhesive discs are not rated to hold double LPs or albums with gate fold jackets.* Permanent Installation Use the included screws and anchors for a permanent and secure installation that will hold the weight of any size record. Screws work great on drywall, bricks, wood, and many other surfaces. BROUGHT TO LIFE FROM BACKERS IN OVER 19 COUNTRIES! Thanks to our successful Kickstarter campaign, we are proud that our product has reached record collectors in over 19 countries so far! We have learned how universal the support for the vinyl community is around the world and hope to continue creating products that help all vinyl fans interact and connect with their music. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Showcase your vinyl How did you come up with the idea for this product? The idea started when I was moving into a new apartment. I decided I wanted to hang some of my favorite album covers on a few of my walls. I searched for album frames but quickly realized that most were too expensive and I did not like the idea of “locking” the albums behind glass frames. I wanted to be able to play my records and quickly change the albums on display. I started to explore some of the DIY options for creating shelves for albums. I came up with the concept after finding a photo of a record sitting on a \"shelf\" that was simply two upside down coat hooks. It gave me the idea that I could create wall mounts without creating a full frame around an album. What makes your product special? What really sets our product apart is how drastically it strays from the idea of a frame. The notion that a frame must be a complete border around an album is what causes the many problems we find with them today. They are either made with cheap material and fall apart, or they are too expensive. Our product challenges the idea of a frame by using a unique installation process to achieve the same end result while using nearly 95% less material. By doing so, we can create a display that highlights the albums themselves and allows for lower costs while maintaining a quality product and solution. What has been the best part of your startup experience? I would have to say that the early feedback we received from our Kickstarter was what truly brought the product to life for the first time. I was amazed by how quickly a community formed around the product once I launched the Kickstarter. I was constantly receiving encouragement, feedback and advice on the product. Most of all, it became clear that backers are there to invest in you just as much as your product. It is a feeling that ultimately drives you every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bRzI5h-XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Q","source_asin":"B01GFAJIXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764218","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GFAJIXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GFAJIXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
