window.products.push({"id":764458,"name":"DriftAway 3 Piece Harbor Quilt Set Bedspreads Coverlets Sailboat Ocean Printed Pattern Cover Prewashed Navy Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vXImooy0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester 3 pieces quilt set, including 1 quilt: 100’’ x 106’’, 2 pillow shams: 20’’ x 26’’. PERFECT HOME DECORATION: Classic navy color with vibrant sailboat patterns will add lively decoration to your bedroom. Durable quilts with tight stitching and seams which can be used for all season. Classic design of artistic bedspread helps to ensure your sleep quality. Soft and Lightweight - This quilt set is made of 100% polyester, woven with the best craftsmanship. Exquisitely designed with a perfect combination of durability and softness. It gives you the ultimate soft and warm feel at a great value and keeps you comfortable all through the night. Matching window treatment available from our brand DriftAway, highly recommend use the one series together in your bedroom. Care Instructions: Machine wash cold, gentle cycle, only non-chlorine bleach, tumble dry low and cool iron. Use front loader machine (or top loader without agitator) to avoid tearing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vXImooy0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DriftAway","source_asin":"B095YD3PV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764458","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095YD3PV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095YD3PV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":764459,"name":"DIY Cube Small Aquarium Sponge Filter (Sponge Only) 3.5 x 3.5 x 5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yOVdYxd7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why we need to aerate wine A wine aerator helps improve flavor and bouquet instantly. Using wine air aerator, especially when selecting a young, red wine, allows the introduction of oxygen, and so a chemical process takes place in the wine, enabling you to enjoy its full range of flavor. This mimics the process of aging almost perfectly. Have you ever heard that you need to let your wine breathe in order to enjoy its full bouquet, or have you ever heard of a sulfite wine filter, and wondered what the big deal was? How a wine aerator helps to remove sulfites The sulfates are removed in this process; added oxygen reacts and combines with phenols, which are bitter compounds, and these actually sink down to the bottom of your wine bottle. Wine areators for bottles and wine strainer remove sulfites from wine - these wine accessories work as sulfite removal for wine. Oxygen also reacts with other compounds, often causing them to break apart, leaving you better able to detect the distinct tastes that make your selection unique. Thus, the tannins are broken down, and the wine is both smoother and has a fuller taste. Wine aerators are must-have item for any wine lovers Are you under the impression that if you are to enjoy your wine as a true wine enthusiast, you need a lot of various wine tools? No need for a large wine decanter that takes up a great deal of space – this wine areator is also a no drip pourer, making it a wonderful wine accessory gift. You won’t need any other tool, because this red wine aerator kit contains the best bottle gadgets for your wine tasting needs. While some aerators are made of glass, our acrylic pouring spout is safer, and altogether a modern, unique design. This wine decanter set is must-have item for all wine lovers – young or well experienced, male or female – and is a perfect choice for birthdays, holiday gifts, or celebrations of achievement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yOVdYxd7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vinvoli","source_asin":"B01C5UVMAE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01C5UVMAE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01C5UVMAE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
