window.products.push({"id":764464,"name":"Harrison Queen All-in-One Set, 86\" x 86\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qwtdGz-7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Harrison Queen All-in-One Set, 86\" x 86\" - Cool, crisp, contemporary and convenient! All-in-One sets make decorating so easy. Harrison is a smart plaid in sienna, olive and taupe. Sets include a reversible comforter, bedskirt and two standard shams (one with twin, king shams for king set), PLUS a complete 180-200-count cotton-rich sheet set that includes one flat and one fitted sheet and two standard pillowcases (one case with twin, king cases with king). Polyester/cotton. Machine washable. Imported. (182256AW )","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qwtdGz-7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homevisions","source_asin":"B000IM3MZU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000IM3MZU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000IM3MZU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":764465,"name":"LATEC Alarm Clocks, Large LED Digital Alarm Clock with Temperature, Snooze, USB Charging and Dual Alarms Multi Ringtones for Bedroom, Bedside, Living ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bp3CGM64L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Meet all Your Alarm Needs: Compact streamline design yet large number display with temperature. 2 alarms can be set, such as one for wake up, one for meeting. Moreover, the snooze function let you can get another 5mins snooze time with an easy click. When the alarm goes off, touch the SNOOZE/LIGHT button to enter snooze mode. Press any other button to exit snooze mode. Sound Actived - More Energy-saving: This is a smart voice-activated alarm clock, no need to be plugged in all the time. That is to say it's screen will wake up for 6 seconds when you make a gentle sound. Gently touch the clock, tapping your desk, coughing, clapping your hands, etc., will magically make your alarm clock go on. These function make this clock perfect for bedrooms. You can sleep at night without being disturbed by the brightness from the LED screen. Charge One Hour But Use for Ten Days: This Bedside clock includes a charging USB cable which is for your convenience for powering(Adapter is not included). It can be used for 10 days after one hour of charging. A built-in button battery for saving your clock-settings in case of power outages. Time display support both 12hrs and 24 hrs format. 16 Alarm Sounds & 3 Adjustable Volumes: Contrary to the low alarm sounds of other LED digital alarm clocks, our alarm clock offers 16 kinds of pleasant alarm sounds, including bird music, beep, piano music, soft and classic music, etc. Now, just choose your favorite ringtone for a good morning. Moreover, the alarm sound can choose 3 volume levels (30dB to 90dB). Maximum volume is very loud which even suitable for heavy sleeper. Lifetime Quality Assurance: Buy with confidence. Please be assured that we¡¯ll always stand behind our products. If you don't understand anything about the alarm clock, such as function, operation, etc., please be free to contact us. Your satisfaction is not an option, it's a guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bp3CGM64L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LATEC","source_asin":"B08T6H7KLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T6H7KLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T6H7KLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":764466,"name":"ArtWall Zen Still Life Gallery-Wrapped Canvas Art by Elena Ray, 12 by 18-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91M3hOl4PqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Art Wall, Elena Ray 'Zen Still Life' Gallery-Wrapped Canvas is a high-quality canvas print example of a Still Life Art photograph depicting a water bowl and Raku vase with dried flowers and stones. Elena Ray creates mixed media art exploring psychological revelation, spiritual unfolding, healing and energy. Her photography is focused on the holistic arts and the people who practice them. She dabbles in Chinese calligraphy and makes Wabi-sabi collages. Her work can be seen in many publications including those by Hay House Publishing, Sounds True publications and Spirituality and Health Magazine. Elena is a yoga student and desert soul. She works and lives in Joshua Tree, California with her husband and their two cats.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91M3hOl4PqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtWall","source_asin":"B07CR5Z3Z3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CR5Z3Z3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CR5Z3Z3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
