window.products.push({"id":764494,"name":"Fette Filter - Vacuum Filter Compatible with E2 Style. Compare to Part # EF144 and EL65521. (Pack of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810SFRwHOUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Vacuum Filter Compatible with E2 Style. Contains 2 Vacuum Filters. Compatible with the following Vacuum Models: EL2001A, EL2003A, EL2010A, EL2021A, EL2022A, EL2023AX, EL2024AX, EL2029A, EL2029AE, EL2030A, EL2040A, EL2050A, EL2055A, EL2055B, EL2081A, EL2089A, EL2095A, EL820A. Compare to Part # EF144 and EL65521. Packaging may vary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810SFRwHOUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fette Filter","source_asin":"B07GBXRD83","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GBXRD83","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GBXRD83","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":764495,"name":"Fletchers' Mill Muddler, Cocktail Muddler, Solid Wood, Ideal Bartender Tool for Old Fashioned, Mojitos - 7 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-6xPmzvJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Making great cocktails is an art. And this medium, like most, requires good quality tools. Fletchers' Mill 7-Inch Cocktail Muddler is made of solid, American hardwood. Use it to mash and crush citrus fruits, herbs and spices; use it for making drinks such as mojitos, mint juleps and caipirinhas. It's a barware essential. And, it's an indispensable kitchen tool. Ergonomically shaped handle, provides more force and less hand and arm stress. By Fletchers' Mill. Made by artisans in Maine, USA. Fletchers' Mill is a family owned company. For two generations, the Fletchers' family has owned and operated the finest mills and manufacturing facilities for crafting wood pepper mills, salt mills, muddlers and rolling pins. Tradition and wisdom passed down from a family of roll-up-your-sleeves American entrepreneurs, the current generation of Fletchers grew up in the company before taking ownership, working in the business from the sawmills through the mechanics to management - knowing the business from top to bottom. In the modernized sawmill, local maple or cherry logs are processed into boards, squares and dowels and then kiln dried. The prepared wood is then turned or molded into one of the thousands of items. Most of the sawdust and scrap wood generated is used to heat our factories and kilns and the rest sold to local business who manufacture wood pellets used to heat homes. Located in the western mountains of Maine, sourcing wood locally and from Forest Stewardship Council (FSW) certified suppliers, employing around 100 people - Fletchers' Mill represents quality, community, sustainability and craftsmanship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-6xPmzvJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fletchers Mill","source_asin":"B00EAHTMH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EAHTMH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EAHTMH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
