window.products.push({"id":764534,"name":"Beaquicy DE64-00760A Door Hook Latch Key - Replacement for Sam-Sung Microwave - Replaces DE64-01308A, 1557593, AP4224485, PS4229162","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xZHz4+IRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ 【PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS】: DE64-00760A Door Hook Latch Key is for microwaves and is designed for keeping the microwave door closed during operation. The size is about 7.8 inches×2 inches. Please keep the microwave oven door closed during operation. Because the high-voltage capacitor in the microwave oven retains a lethal charge even when the microwave oven is unplugged. Please check the important information of the microwave door key before buying, especial the model numbers and dimensions. ✅ 【HIGH QUALITY】: The package includes 1 x DE64-00760A Microwave Door Key. The replacement part is made from durable high quality ABS plastic material and well-tested by the manufacturer - Meets OEM standards - Ensure long-lasting and effective performance. The part can fix the following symptoms: ①Door to microwave would not stay closed; ②Microwave would not come on due to broken Door Key (Latch); ③Plastic hook on door key latch on microwave broke; ④Spring let go. ✅ 【WIDE COMPATIBLE】: DE64-00760A Door Hook Latch Key can replacement for Ken-more, May-tag, Sam-sung microwave. ◆Replaces Number: DE64-01308A, 1557593, AP4224485, PS4229162, EAP4229162, 40185044110, 40185043310, 40185049010, 40185052010, 40185059010, ME16K3000AW/AC, SMH7174WE/XAA, ME16K3000AS/AA-03, ME16K3000AS/AA-04, ME21R7051SS, ME21R706BAT/AA, 40180092010, 40180092700, 40180093010, 40180093700, 40180094700, 40180099010, 40185042010, 40185042210, 40185042310, 40185043010, 40185043210, etc. ✅ 【AFTER-SALES GUARANTEE】: DE64-01308A DE64-00760A Door Hook Latch Key supports 90 days return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅ 【CONVENIENT FOR YOUR LIFE】 : Before replacing DE64-00760A Door Hook Latch Key, disconnect the power to the microwave oven and prepare a screwdriver and putty knife before starting any repairs. Use a screwdriver to pry open the door cover, and then use a putty knife to separate the inner door trim in the latch area, and quickly replace the latch-snap the interior trim back to its original position. The simple operation is that you can compelate by yourself, no need to change the microwave.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xZHz4+IRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0832HP92W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0832HP92W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0832HP92W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
