window.products.push({"id":764656,"name":"Drapifytex Antique Bronze Grommet Drapery Faux Linen Room Darkening Curtain, Bedroom Drapery Living Room Panel, Snow White, 50 Inches Width by 84 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f6fd4HaGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why You Need It Faux Linen Room Darkening Curtain is a nice way to wake up your windows. Durable linen and exquisite craftsmanship make these curtains last for a long time. Linen textured fabric look modern and more expensive. The soft texture brings a casual warmth to the room. The sound on the streets would no longer bother you. Whether it¡¯s jet lag, late sleeper, shift worker. Enjoy your favorite movie in the nice darkness with no glare on the screen. DETERMINE DRAPERY FINISHED WIDTH Single panel width = ( Rod Track Full Length + Fullness 1.5x-2x ) / Panel quantity FULLNESS To avoid draperies looking like a stretched sheet, you need to consider to add fullness for additional width to cover. Less fullness will produce a more tailored look, while more fullness will create a richer, more opulent appearance. We suggest fullness 1.5x-2x. 1.8x is normal consider and it is for overlap and possible some fabrics are not easy to be stretched in neat and straight shape at top when hanging. No more width fullness is needed. For example, rod full length is 100 inches, the single panel width need 90 inches ( 100 x 1.8 = 180, 180/2) if you need 2 panels to hang. FINISHED LENGTH Measure from bottom of rings to top of floor or top of window sill, measure the length from the top of pole to finish for grommet style. Curtain length is measured from the top of grommet to bottom. Approximately 1\" of curtain will be added above the eyelet to stand above the pole. This does not affect the hanging length of your curtains, but creates a finished look - you don't need to account for this additional 1\" in your measurements.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f6fd4HaGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Drapifytex","source_asin":"B07R32YH3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R32YH3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R32YH3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
