window.products.push({"id":764780,"name":"AMZRicher Orange Brown Gray Beige Sheer Curtains 72 Inch Length 2 Panels Set, Abstract Oil Painting Texture Semi Transparent Voile Rod Pocket Curtains","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WYE+v+SzS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorative Gauze Generally, gauze curtains have a soft texture and a looming hazy beauty. When the breeze blows gently, the raised gauze curtains fly by the window, arousing people's desire to fly. In the past, the screens were basically white, and they were generally used as window screens to set off the curtains. As people have different preferences for gauze curtains, the gauze curtains appear colorful. The gauze curtain has also changed in the hanging method. You can simply hang a gauze curtain as the gap between two spaces; you can also put the gauze curtain on the outside of the curtain and cover it on the curtain. Looking from the room in this way, it gives people a vague and subtle beauty, especially when a few flowers are dotted on the gauze curtain, the looming meaning is even more obvious. Functionality and Performance 1. Light Filtering Sheer Curtains: These super soft chiffon sheer panels features will beautifully scatter and softly filters light for a serene ambiance that transforms your space into a magical setting. 2. Decorative Sheer Curtains: Modern sheers can let to stand on thier own, or pair with other curtains for an elegant trendy, expensive look and gauzy decorative effect. 3. Atmosphere creating sheer curtains: They create a hazy sense of beauty, when look through your window with our ethereal sheer curtain, the outside world become dreamlike just like you are dreaming.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WYE+v+SzS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMZRicher","source_asin":"B099YTLZ3P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099YTLZ3P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099YTLZ3P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
