window.products.push({"id":764829,"name":"COTA Global Sea Shell Refrigerator Rockstone Magnets Set of 4 - Assorted Resin Beach Design, Fun, & Cute Ocean Animals Magnets for Kitchen Fridge, Loc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DeNs3o-8S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE OCEAN SHELL ROCKSTONE MAGNET DECOR COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Add an extra touch of beach vibes to your day and display your collection of cute ocean life novelty magnets! Perfect resin magnet decor can attach to any metallic surface and will make it look breezy & cool. Shell Rockstone Magnets are decorated with beach theme vibrant colorful decorations. A must-have home and office accessory for hanging beach vacation memories. THE COOL FRIDGE MAGNETS ARE FOR WHIMSICAL NOVELTIES LOVERS – Perfect home & office ornament for magnet collectors & sea life animal lovers who'd like to add funky decor magnets to their stationery to help them stay organized. Surprise your colleagues with entertaining unique decorative Rockstone magnets to hang pictures, memories, pictures & random notes. Ideal for parents who love leaving cute notes for their little ones or post grocery lists. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF CUTE REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Includes CoTa Global Assorted design Set of 4 Shell Rockstone Fridge Magnets. The magnets feature stonelike shells adorned with little starfish, fish, turtle, & dolphin. Rockstone magnetic set feature rhinestones & realistic details & is colored with vibrant colors making them the perfect accent for plain-colored refrigerators. Kitchen fridge magnets measure 2.75″L x 3″W x 0.5″H. HIGH-QUALITY NAUTICAL ROCKSTONE MAGNETS – Fun magnets for refrigerator are made of premium quality resin construction molded in unique shapes and have a strong magnet attached to the back of each 3D-shaped colorful shell figure. The shell figures are shaped in a unique way, resulting in the perfect decoration item for your office, locker, and refrigerator door. Make the cute shell magnets stand out and display the beautifully designed shell. IDEAL USE FOR THE SEA CREATURE REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Decorate your kitchen fridge door, dishwasher, locker, whiteboards, cabinet, & any metal surfaces that attract magnets with fun novelty magnets. Shell magnets make a cool display on the kitchen fridge and an amusing locker decor to help in posting notes, recipes, checklists, reminders, photos, and drawings. Perfect set of functional multi-use magnets for the home or any office work-space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DeNs3o-8S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B01M5FE5LJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M5FE5LJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M5FE5LJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":764830,"name":"Sebo Automatic X4 Upright Vacuum Cleaner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":849.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gHBfVC7NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[October 20, 2020, 9:37 AM] Jadhav, Aditya: The AUTOMATIC X is the world’s most technically advanced and uniquely easy-to-use vacuum cleaner! The 12-inch X4 features a truly automatic height adjustment, using an electronic controller that measures the resistance of the spinning brush roller against the floor to signal up or down adjustments, which ensures optimal performance on both carpets and hard floors. The user is also alerted to clogs, a worn brush, or a full bag, and the vacuum automatically shuts off when brush obstructions occur to protect the motor and belts from damage. The X also has an instant-use cleaning wand and suction hose, a lifetime belt warranty, tool-free brush roller removal, a 40-foot power cord, and three on-board attachments. The X4 Boost model offers a choice between two modes of automatic brush agitation! The default setting is perfect for most flooring types, but by activating the Boost Button, greater resistance against the spinning brush roller is allowed before height adjustments are made, which causes more aggressive brush action. Twelve-inch Power Head Width Three On-board Tools Included: Dusting Brush, Crevice Nozzle and Upholstery Nozzle Instant-use Wand and Suction Hose A Low 5 1/2-inch Profile Automatic Height Adjustment: From Hard Floors to Carpets Brush Adjustment Indicator Lights Brush Obstruction Light with Automatic Shut Off Worn Brush Light. Easy Brush Removal and Cleaning Stationary Use Light Bag Full or Clog Light with Automatic Shut Off Combination Carrying Handle with Rotating Cord Hook Large Filter Bag Forty-foot Cord Easy Maintenance Hospital-grade Filtration for Allergy and Asthma Relief Excellent Pet Vacuum . . . Highly Effective Pet Hair Removal! Five-year Warranty with Lifetime Belt Warranty!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gHBfVC7NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sebo","source_asin":"B000JLCVAM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000JLCVAM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000JLCVAM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
