window.products.push({"id":764869,"name":"Circulon Elite 10-Inch Covered Sauté","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WZKEA0D1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Whether you're sautéing foods or preparing risotto, this is the quintessential piece for any chef's kitchen. With its helper handle, along with the Inside/ Outside nonstick surface, pouring food out of the pan is a breeze. Amazon.com Sauté chicken strips, onions, and bell peppers for fajitas with this 10-inch sauté pan from Circulon's Elite cookware line. Equipped with a fitted lid to expedite the cooking process and contain nutrients and flavor, the sauté holds up to 3 quarts. Craftsmen constructed the sauté with their hard-anodized aluminum to deflect dents, corrosion, and other signs of wear and tear. Circulon's patented TOTAL Hi-Low Food Release system ensures even heat distribution while nonstick coating lines the pan inside and out for easy cooking and cleaning. The pan's edges flare subtly to eliminate messes while pouring. One loop-style handle and one 10-inch straight handle securely rivet to the sauté pan. Silicone rubber covers the 18/10 stainless-steel handles for ergonomic comfort and durability. The long handle also has a hole installed for hanging purposes. Crafted in tempered glass with a stainless-steel perimeter, the clear lid allows chefs to monitor progress without releasing heat or splattered grease. Another loop handle affixes to the shatter-proof lid. The sauté and its lid sustain oven temperatures up to 400 degrees F for rewarming contents or other baking purposes. Wash the sauté by hand, taking care to avoid abrasive scouring pads and cleansers to protect the nonstick surfaces. A limited lifetime warranty covers this item. Made in Thailand, the sauté measures 21-1/5 by 11-9/10 by 5-1/3 inches and weighs 6-1/5 pounds upon shipping. --Jessica Reuling","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WZKEA0D1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Circulon","source_asin":"B0006TJ60K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006TJ60K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006TJ60K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
