window.products.push({"id":764923,"name":"Cleaver knife, 6.7\" meat cleaver X50CrMoV15 High Carbon German Steel , Ultra Sharp Chinese Chef Knife with Non-slip Ergonomic Handle and gift box, for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618bo7AIQmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"German High Carbon Steel: The meat cleaver knife is made of high quality high carbon German stainless steel 1.4116 to ensure excellent performance. The high carbon content makes the blade stronger and durable and has a longer lasting sharp edge retention, the blade is forged in one piece, excellent cutting process, does not rust or deform, and provides a high level of corrosion and wear resistance. Easy to clean and maintain. Ultra Sharp Edge: The blade is finely polished, with a hardness of 57±2 HRC, 6.7\" cleaver is extremely sharp, and the thickness of the back of the blade is only 2.5MM. This chinese cleaver is light and comfortable, especially suitable for women. Due to the thin blade, this Chinese chef's knife is suitable for cutting meat, fish, vegetables and other soft tissue ingredients, to prevent damage to the edge, do not cut bones. Well Designed: The blade body is forged in one piece, the proportion of hilt and blade face is in line with the golden proportion. This design not only makes the cleaver knife look delicate, but also makes it more convenient to place the force point on the food. The force point will not tilt forward or move back, so that you will not be tired when cutting for a long time. Ergonomical Handle: The wooden handle is made of log handle, ergonomically designed curve, finger guard position, one-piece full handle blade, splicing process to prevent the handle from falling off, more stable and safer. Non-slip and comfortable grip enhances hand feel, making the vegetable cleaver knife easy to hold without getting tired after prolonged use. Great Gift: The Chinese cleaver come in high-quality gift packaging, making a good knife the perfect gift! Offering a thoughtful solution to the conundrum of housewarming, weddings, anniversaries, and even birthdays, we offer an elegant gift box that packs easily and securely and displays stylishly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618bo7AIQmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MFSDAY","source_asin":"B09Z2MK7RQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z2MK7RQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z2MK7RQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
