window.products.push({"id":764973,"name":"Alchemade 100% Pure Hammered Copper Pitcher - 60 Ounces - To Use For Water, Juice, Ice Tea, Cocktails, Beer & More - Will Keep Your Drinks Cold Longer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611l4KK2L6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring some classic elegance into your home with this beautiful 100% pure hammered copper pitcher. This 60oz copper pitcher for drinking water is 9\" high and features a seamless hygienic interior, soldered handle and spout so you get a perfect pour. It is ideal for everyday use as a water vessel, while adding a bit of style to your table at the same time. In Ayurvedic practices, drinking from a copper jug is actually recommended. Pair with any of our pure copper mugs or tumblers as well for a complete set of copperware. This pure copper jug is also perfect for entertaining guests. Add ice and your beverage of choice and this carafe will keep your drink perfectly chilled and fresh, enhancing the flavor and quality of your beverage. Serve moscow mules with our copper mugs or any mixed drinks with rum, tequila, gin, or whiskey. They also work well as a beer pitcher, for wine, iced-tea, lemonade and more. These copper pitchers make a great addition for any home bar and pair well with any of our other copper barware items. If you are in need of a special gift for a wedding, birthday, Christmas, holiday, housewarming, Valentine's Day, Father's Day, Mother's Day or ANY occasion, our copper pitchers are a perfect choice to make a great impression! Recommended for cold beverages only. Please hand wash only using warm water and soft soap. Not suitable for dishwasher or microwave use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611l4KK2L6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alchemade","source_asin":"B079SL3BSL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079SL3BSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079SL3BSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
