window.products.push({"id":764980,"name":"Norpro Apple Master-Apple, Potato, Parer, Slicer & Corer with Vacuum Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zqg0u0crL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Norpro APPLE MASTER 866-Capable of 3 separate functions: pare, core and slice; pare only; or slice and core only. Features a stay-sharp, deluxe stainless steel blade. Vacuum base holds securely to any smooth surface. Includes a deluxe paring and slicing/coring blade. Also ideal for potatoes and pears. Not just for apple paring, coring and slicing use the Norpro Apple-Mate® and Apple-Master® to create curly fries, chips-on-a-stick using russets or sweet potatoes. Scallop potatoes. Quickly create onion twists to deep fry, make french onion soup or to garnish a steak or hamburger. Core and slice pears for dessert. Recipes and instructions included. Hand washing recommended. Amazon.com If the only thing holding you back from baking scrumptious apple pies is the prospect of all that laborious peeling, feast your eyes on the solution to tired, sore fingers and wrists. Norpro has created the ultimate apple peeler, solidly constructed and designed for years of use. It pares, cores, and slices any apple in seconds--almost automatically. All you have to do is place the apple in the machine, turn the crank, and watch the skin disappear. The coring shaft is made of carbon steel with nickel plating, and is engineered to turn smoothly and never warp, ensuring a more efficient, faster, more uniform slicing-and-peeling process. The prong fork is durable, heavy-duty nickel-plated zinc, and easily pushes the flesh of an apple to prepare it for paring. The paring blade is stainless steel, and can be adjusted for thickness by the simple loosening of a thumbscrew. Spring tension on the paring arm gradually adjusts to every contour of the apple, which allows the blade to peel smoothly and uniformly. The entire machine is set on a heavy-duty vacuum base that \"sticks\" to any smooth surface with the flip of a lever, so you can literally operate it with one hand once you set the apple in the machine. It has a number of sharp blades on it, so it's not something to be used by children without close supervision, but for an adult it's quite safe and easy to use. --Jonathon Tudor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zqg0u0crL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Norpro","source_asin":"B00G0NR7AM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-764980","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G0NR7AM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G0NR7AM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
